{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1000_null", "source_sha256": "dba7a06edcf26fdecfd87de3f4ae5394e8e319b5b4e961909c70829dfdbf357e", "ja": "バレンタインイベント、本番直前……", "zh": "情人节活动正式开场前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dc94968325946e35a0c530dfbf2ceede01feb98bc4b2fabfa03713c7f117e574", "ja": "茜、そろそろ出番だけど、準備はできてるか？", "zh": "茜，你差不多要上场了，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "7026c3e1db730aea9a0f9b931342ae16dc62fe361296c0be9e6f7ce3ec5eba02", "ja": "全然ダメだよ、{$P$}ちゃん。\nなぜなら、茜ちゃんは聞いてしまったから……！", "zh": "小{$P$}，小茜完全没准备好。\n因为小茜都听见了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7f6595297162d2621e03973300f006c8c6029ae208a169185f9e9d88e4b1a25a", "ja": "全然って、急にどうしたんだ。昨日の\nリハーサルの時は、のびのびやってたじゃないか。", "zh": "你怎么突然说完全没准备好？\n昨天排练时你不是还很轻松吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3cc2f1db81e3a961de3315dde4236036398bcf933647cd5eee8d5b7bca29ed20", "ja": "それに、聞いたって……一体何を？", "zh": "而且……你到底是听见了什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "718ec5a1239f6e397238d7b9b4ebcbd6f2916b8feee0bb32898010ac114d3f1a", "ja": "何って、ファンのみんなが話してるのをだよ。\n茜ちゃん、昨日の帰りに、立ち聞きしちゃって……。", "zh": "那还用问，当然是听见粉丝们在聊天啊。\n小茜昨天在回程路上偷听到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "729bd50170b09b048543e043cb3ce2b51a5354a3194dd18a1bd9fe8736df49e1", "ja": "どうやら今日のイベント、ファンのみんなは\n美少女アイドル茜ちゃんからのチョコがほしいらしい！", "zh": "粉丝们似乎想要在今天的活动中，\n收到美少女偶像小茜送的巧克力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5a50b4a64c8e362ce0953b3d14de29755e12d4237ce592aa9b50374c87e2e7f8", "ja": "まあ、バレンタインライブだからな……。", "zh": "也是啦，毕竟是情人节演唱会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "6a20a102516d1a08fa1b19df564b687a27d0c584de5dd69c1b213a1caf12bbdf", "ja": "わかってるよ、{$P$}ちゃん！\n全ては、茜ちゃんがかわいすぎるからだって！", "zh": "小{$P$}，小茜明白！\n这一切都是因为小茜太可爱了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "fc2b87665b76973001247a0edda8c9c8460947cedeaa9f20f39e88168ad2b214", "ja": "だから茜ちゃん、みんなに手作りのチョコを\n用意しようと思って、がんばってみたんだけど……。", "zh": "所以小茜想要准备手工巧克力送给大家，\n就试着努力了一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5fac17d64a947d2a0baf76ab5f4e8a575110fa22da1c784d7bcb38aa053bfc60", "ja": "えっ。本当に作ったのか？", "zh": "咦？你真的做了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "905fcfdbccf6659a857bb8ef49eed3363aa355dc84a86b8c89794d4308920637", "ja": "そう！　けど、ムリ！　1個しか作れなかった！\n世界一カワイイ茜ちゃんにも、不可能はあった！", "zh": "没错！但是失败了！小茜只做出一份巧克力！\n世界第一可爱的小茜也有做不到的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7104ed39b60ee5d9828e79dec976dc47a04ec24521498d49aa62a95ca12fcb41", "ja": "そうだよな、さすがに無理だよな……。\nいや、いくらかわいくてもそれは無理だと思う。", "zh": "说得也是，果然是不可能吧……\n不对，我想再怎么可爱也是办不到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "c5819612fa64864b59f81282e40a6a15b6e6ba93c06c2d2c5321127aa6be2c0a", "ja": "ぐぬぬ……みんなが期待してるものがわかってるのに、\n茜ちゃんの力をもってしても、応えられないなんて！", "zh": "唔唔唔……明明知道大家都很期待，\n凭小茜的力量却无法回应大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1014_p", "source_sha256": "96f1e42cf46ce2af8a34cf6e09ed3cdad8ffbb89ec0dbf1f6c540052e6b85304", "ja": "まあまあ、茜……取り敢えず落ち着こう。\nそれに今日の仕事は、チョコを配る事じゃないだろ？", "zh": "茜，别丧气啦……总之你先冷静下来。\n而且今天的工作不是发送巧克力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "03cb3121f035e9ad8cd5ecca1253121476902af9ad5122d7c0cb01532fe483df", "ja": "はっ！？　そ、そうだった……。今日の茜ちゃんは、\nお菓子屋さんじゃなくてアイドルだった！", "zh": "啊！？对、对喔……\n今天的小茜不是糖果店老板，而是偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "e1c32d76b704a85287a3d177c668c6ed5c8fac25cba1dd9242734862c25b0d6b", "ja": "アイドルのお仕事は、歌やダンスで\nファンのみんなに楽しんでもらうこと……！", "zh": "偶像的工作是用唱歌跳舞，\n为粉丝带来欢乐的时光……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1017_p", "source_sha256": "88e72931b58d096926511fc2f2920a1176fbb46b8ac058695cfb777e92d997c3", "ja": "そうだな。ファンのみんなも、\n茜のステージを楽しみにしてるはずだよ。", "zh": "就是说啊。\n粉丝们应该也很期待茜的表演喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "04e3f77cfd4ea28e6c80587aa592479cff3e619a8ffb5888ab22197f7a0749cf", "ja": "いや～、茜ちゃんとしたことが、\n自分のかわいさでちょっと目がくらんでたみたいだね！", "zh": "真是的～居然犯了这种错，\n小茜好像有点被自己的可爱给冲昏头了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "9009aeb290f63dcb448c4eaf59d58447d8cd54b4adf9fb40127ae1439f28b825", "ja": "それなら今日は、チョコよりも甘くてスイ～ツな\n茜ちゃんボイスで、みんなをメロメロにしてあげよー！", "zh": "既然如此，小茜今天要用比巧克力更甜～美动人的\n小茜歌声把大家迷得神魂颠倒──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1020_p", "source_sha256": "b8ebc4ddaa71587b02544cd42a3cfa1c2801182cda3e2298030ac95a63435e83", "ja": "ああ、その調子だ！\n楽しみにしてるから、頑張ってくれ。", "zh": "嗯，就是这样！\n我很期待，你要加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "a70babbb56bbe3d393cd901cc15cbd67762ecbca19ccad612b9ef4c07618a577", "ja": "うん！　……あ、{$P$}ちゃん。\nチョコ持ってきたから、あとで食べてもいいよ！", "zh": "好！啊，小{$P$}，\n小茜把巧克力带来了，你等一下可以吃掉喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0104_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "562f5a64ba52b2caf7cbc78e87c388c8099f37d333e248de1475a7ac2b9eb4a1", "ja": "1個しか作れなかった、超貴重なやつだからね！\n茜ちゃんのファン代表として、心して食べてね！", "zh": "那可是只做出一份的超贵重巧克力！\n你要作为小茜粉丝的代表，用心品尝喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
